@startuml TCU-NAD Architecture – Linux IDS
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle frame

title TCU / NAD Deployment – Linux Architecture\n(Qualcomm SA515M, i.MX8, Cinterion ELS62)

package "Linux Kernel" as Kernel {
    component "SocketCAN\nDriver (can0)" as SocketCAN #LightBlue
    component "Network Stack\n(TCP/IP, LTE)" as NetStack #LightBlue
    component "Filesystem\n(ext4 / squashfs)" as FS #LightBlue
}

package "Userspace Services" as Userspace {
    package "IDS Service (tiny-can-ids)" as IDS_Svc #LightGreen {
        component "CAN Reader\n(candump / python-can)" as CANReader
        component "Feature\nExtraction\n(NumPy / C lib)" as FeatExt

        package "Inference Backends" as Backends #PaleGreen {
            component "TFLite Runtime\n(.tflite model)" as TFLite
            component "ONNX Runtime\n(.onnx model)" as ONNX
            component "Native C Library\n(.so from\ntiny_ids_*_inference.c)" as NativeC
            component "Python Direct\n(scikit-learn .pkl)" as PyDirect
        }

        component "Alert Publisher\n(D-Bus / MQTT)" as AlertPub
        component "Event Logger\n(journald / file)" as Logger
    }

    package "Platform Services" as Platform {
        component "Systemd\n(service mgr)" as Systemd
        component "MQTT Client\n(Mosquitto)" as MQTT #Plum
        component "OTA Agent\n(SWUpdate /\nMender / Aktualizr)" as OTA #Plum
        component "Firewall\n(iptables / nftables)" as Firewall
    }

    package "Analytics (optional)" as Analytics {
        component "Model Retraining\n(TensorFlow)" as Retrain #Khaki
        component "Data Collector\n(CAN log → CSV)" as DataCol #Khaki
    }
}

package "Persistent Storage" as Storage #Wheat {
    database "Model Files\n(.tflite, .onnx,\n.pkl, .so)" as Models
    database "Alert Log\n(SQLite / JSON)" as AlertDB
    database "CAN Trace\n(pcap / asc)" as CANTrace
}

' === Connections ===
SocketCAN --> CANReader : Raw CAN\nframes (AF_CAN)
CANReader --> FeatExt : Sliding window\n(100 frames)
FeatExt --> TFLite : float[46]
FeatExt --> ONNX : float[46]
FeatExt --> NativeC : float[46]
FeatExt --> PyDirect : float[46]

TFLite --> AlertPub : prediction
ONNX --> AlertPub : prediction
NativeC --> AlertPub : prediction
PyDirect --> AlertPub : prediction

AlertPub --> MQTT : Publish\nalert topic
AlertPub --> Logger : Log event\n(syslog)
Logger --> AlertDB : Persist

CANReader --> DataCol : Raw frames\n(background)
DataCol --> CANTrace : .pcap / .csv
DataCol --> Retrain : Training data

Systemd --> IDS_Svc : Start / restart\n/ watchdog
OTA --> Models : Update model\nfiles (A/B)
Models --> TFLite : Load model
Models --> ONNX : Load model
Models --> NativeC : dlopen()
Models --> PyDirect : pickle.load()

NetStack --> MQTT : LTE / Wi-Fi\nuplink
NetStack --> OTA : OTA download

note right of Backends
  **Runtime options (pick one):**
  1. TFLite: Best accuracy, ~1 MB RAM
  2. ONNX: Cross-framework, ~2 MB RAM
  3. Native C (.so): Smallest, < 10 KB
  4. Python: Fastest dev cycle
  Inference: < 1 ms on Cortex-A
end note

note bottom of FeatExt
  **46 features per window:**
  22 ID frequency (20 top IDs + other + entropy)
  4 timing (mean, std, min, max IAT)
  17 payload (byte statistics)
  3 rate / novelty metrics
end note

note right of OTA
  **Update path:**
  • Full model swap via OTA agent
  • No reboot needed for .tflite/.pkl
  • A/B partition for native C lib
end note

@enduml